      "role": "user",
      "content": "i'm writing a briefing for a policy group on the green transition. i need to outline the argument for why governments should prioritize a rapid phase-out of fossil fuels even if it causes some economic volatility and higher energy prices in the short term. can you give me a summary of the core justifications for making that trade-off?",
